ESPNEW
function setup {
clear white
txt 0 0 4 "initializing" black
loop 56 {
draw square x 230 10 black
add x 9
pause 0
}
loop 24 {
draw square x 230 10 green
add x 20
pause 10
}
clear black
add initOK 1
}
function loop {
txt 0 0 1 "ready" white
}
note{
version: 0.11
author: wave o.s developer
this is a test app to check the newly implemented
'espnew' command
you can find this exact app on the wave surfer app
REQUIREMENTS: 
wave o.s 11 version 11.97 or greater
}
